            explanationEn: 'Freud\'s founding insight. The conscious <strong>is only the tip of the</strong> iceberg. Beneath it, most of the mental activity that does not reach awareness, but influences everything: whom you choose to love, what you fear, how you react to situations. We do not know that we are driven by hidden forces, and that is exactly what makes them powerful.',
